    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_summarizing_sources_reporting_verbs",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-summarizing-sources-01",
        "slug": "b2-summarizing-sources-reporting-verbs",
        "title": "Reporting verbs for summaries",
        "rule_summary": "Use says, explains, argues, reports, and suggests to separate the source's ideas from your own voice.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای جدا کردن حرف منبع از نظر خودمان از says، explains، argues، reports و suggests استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The article argues that small changes can help.",
            "fa": "مقاله استدلال می‌کند که تغییرات کوچک می‌تواند کمک کند."
          },
          {
            "en": "The report suggests two main causes.",
            "fa": "گزارش دو علت اصلی را مطرح می‌کند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_summarizing_sources_relative_clauses",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-summarizing-sources-02",
        "slug": "b2-summarizing-sources-relative-clauses",
        "title": "Relative clauses for detail",
        "rule_summary": "Use who, which, that, and where to add identifying or extra information without starting a new sentence.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با who، which، that و where اطلاعات شناسایی‌کننده یا تکمیلی را بدون جمله جدا اضافه می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I chose a hotel that includes breakfast.",
            "fa": "هتلی را انتخاب کردم که صبحانه دارد."
          },
          {
            "en": "The manager, who joined last year, led the meeting.",
            "fa": "مدیر که پارسال اضافه شد جلسه را هدایت کرد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_summarizing_sources_linking_devices",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-summarizing-sources-03",
        "slug": "b2-summarizing-sources-linking-devices",
        "title": "Cohesive linking devices",
        "rule_summary": "Use however, therefore, in addition, as a result, and meanwhile to make relationships between sentences explicit.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با however، therefore، in addition، as a result و meanwhile رابطه بین جمله‌ها را روشن می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The first option is cheaper. However, it takes longer.",
            "fa": "گزینه اول ارزان‌تر است؛ با این حال بیشتر طول می‌کشد."
          },
          {
            "en": "The deadline moved; therefore, we revised the plan.",
            "fa": "موعد تغییر کرد؛ بنابراین برنامه را بازبینی کردیم."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b2_summarizing_sources_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-summarizing-sources-01",
        "title": "Summarizing Information: part 1",
        "setting": "coffee break",
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What do you think is the main issue here?",
            "translation_fa": "فکر می‌کنی مسئله اصلی اینجا چیه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "The main point of the report is that small scheduling changes reduced waiting time significantly.",
            "translation_fa": "نکته اصلی گزارش اینه که تغییرهای کوچک زمان‌بندی، زمان انتظار رو به شکل قابل‌توجهی کم کرده."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What makes that the most important point?",
            "translation_fa": "چی باعث می‌شه این مهم‌ترین نکته باشه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "I would omit the background detail about the old office because it doesn't affect the conclusion.",
            "translation_fa": "جزئیات پس‌زمینه درباره دفتر قدیمی رو حذف می‌کنم چون روی نتیجه اثر نداره."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
